engine/godot/pulls/124212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124212","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124212.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124212.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-08T18:43:21Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe `_copy_region` was using a loop to copy data byte-by-byte, and that was causing significant lag in my game (I had a MoviePlayer, pausing it worked but hiding it didn't), replacing that byte-by-byte copy with a bulk copy (`memcpy` call) solved the issue.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNote: since this loop is very simple, there is a high chance that it gets optimized away by compilers. (but optimized compile operations take time so I compile the engine with compiler optimization disabled (`optimize=none`). But the change is simple enough that I thought it's worth a pr.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart